# ---------- ② 数据下载强制代理 (解决卡进度条) ----------
# 强制让这两个域名走你的 FINAL（荷兰）节点，保证资源能顺利拉取
HOST-SUFFIX, download.sgameglobal.com, FINAL
HOST-SUFFIX, v2-down-gamelet.sgameglobal.com, FINAL


# ---------- ③ 强制锁定东南亚直连测速 (保底 20ms) ----------
# 明确放行新加坡(SG)等亚太测速节点，告诉系统我们在这连得最快
HOST, gromelink-pingsg.sgameglobal.com, DIRECT
HOST, sgspeed.ino.sgameglobal.com, DIRECT
HOST-KEYWORD, gromelink-link-sg, DIRECT


